{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1263337,\"title\":\"Heart of the Beast\",\"tagline\":\"Survival depends on their bond.\",\"overview\":\"After a harrowing plane crash, Special Forces officer James Belmont and his combat dog, Odin, find themselves stranded deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Together, they are forced into a brutal fight for survival against the elements.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6sYemVUn79UPKz1ZsSG6kPU4RVy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yE766yhgg98tKwTKd8CyNvAtmn6.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":1147,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":102,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":82000000,\"revenue\":192931039,\"director\":\"David Ayer\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":19769,\"name\":\"David Ayer\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7JmWK2wg2StEc9eYjY96s7OJgb7.jpg\"},{\"id\":287,\"name\":\"Brad Pitt\",\"character\":\"James Belmont\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ajNaPmXVVMJFg9GWmu6MJzTaXdV.jpg\"},{\"id\":18999,\"name\":\"J.K. Simmons\",\"character\":\"Watkins\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ScmKoJ9eiSUOthAt1PDNLi8Fkw.jpg\"},{\"id\":2307481,\"name\":\"Anna Lambe\",\"character\":\"Amber\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cKm5ZnAOVc6nD8KAgSDMJdZclYH.jpg\"},{\"id\":2846013,\"name\":\"Justin Melnick\",\"character\":\"Military Soldier\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sE5W8tononGWHKH2Z6GLeUHXeyP.jpg\"},{\"id\":6504999,\"name\":\"Shaun DeZern\",\"character\":\"Military Soldier\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iORM61n9AM6ldFm7C4t8dm9pRLq.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":131631,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4FAA18ZIja70d1Tu5hr5cj2q1sB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lV1P1Q5gLDXVG1ZYCxZHStkcQC3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36557,\"title\":\"Casino Royale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lMrxYKKhd4lqRzwUHAy5gcx9PSO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/klJMCIblHLFwCuGjKz7tyOpekIC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Le Chiffre, a banker to the world's terrorists, is scheduled to participate in a high-stakes poker game in Montenegro, where he intends to use his winnings to establish his financial grip on the terrorist market. M sends Bond—on his maiden mission as a 00 Agent—to attend this game and prevent Le Chiffre from winning. With the help of Vesper Lynd and Felix Leiter, Bond enters the most important poker game in his already dangerous career.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396535,\"title\":\"Train to Busan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vNVFt6dtcqnI7hqa6LFBUibuFiw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/brnfCYyz8EMbBrHgmh8sCwBi5i1.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a zombie virus pushes Korea into a state of emergency, those trapped on an express train to Busan must fight for their own survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840464,\"title\":\"Greenland 2: Migration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2tqCJLsw6uEJ8nJV8BsQXGa3dr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cLFbDVfhllIMybpo2fkGNzehiQG.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having found the safety of the Greenland bunker after the comet Clarke decimated the Earth, the Garrity family must now risk everything to embark on a perilous journey across the wasteland of Europe to find a new home.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":575265,\"title\":\"Mission: Impossible - The Final Reckoning\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKPsC9EFUafRP9SrUznI61getVP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/538U9snNc2fpnOmYXAPUh3zn31H.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ethan Hunt and team continue their search for the terrifying AI known as the Entity — which has infiltrated intelligence networks all over the globe — with the world's governments and a mysterious ghost from Hunt's past on their trail. Joined by new allies and armed with the means to shut the Entity down for good, Hunt is in a race against time to prevent the world as we know it from changing forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":370172,\"title\":\"No Time to Die\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iUgygt3fscRoKWCV1d0C7FbM9TP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x9td0NQha0t44K2qgcMipLOGjVi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bond has left active service and is enjoying a tranquil life in Jamaica. His peace is short-lived when his old friend Felix Leiter from the CIA turns up asking for help. The mission to rescue a kidnapped scientist turns out to be far more treacherous than expected, leading Bond onto the trail of a mysterious villain armed with dangerous new technology.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":37724,\"title\":\"Skyfall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d0IVecFQvsGdSbnMAHqiYsNYaJT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wkA622CCN2X0uwpgqYEOnUYEDf5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bond's latest assignment goes gravely wrong, agents around the world are exposed and MI6 headquarters is attacked. While M faces challenges to her authority and position from Gareth Mallory, the new Chairman of the Intelligence and Security Committee, it's up to Bond, aided only by field agent Eve, to locate the mastermind behind the attack.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":135397,\"title\":\"Jurassic World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkXjL03yWPmiuFqxWEp4zSYVZBY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF6FjTZzRTENfB4R17HDN20jLT2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":74,\"title\":\"War of the Worlds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Biy7R9LfumYshur3YKhpj56MpB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bInicBgSHfQiWLbnRT5jxw9Grvm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ray Ferrier is a divorced dockworker and less-than-perfect father. Soon after his ex-wife and her new husband drop off his teenage son and young daughter for a rare weekend visit, a strange and powerful lightning storm touches down.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":539972,\"title\":\"Kraven the Hunter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1GvBhRxY6MELDfxFrete6BNhBB5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bGGjyPqtNc8hhGkPo8W8D8t90bW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kraven Kravinoff's complex relationship with his ruthless gangster father, Nikolai, starts him down a path of vengeance with brutal consequences, motivating him to become not only the greatest hunter in the world, but also one of its most feared.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5915,\"title\":\"Into the Wild\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jnLnLYP5pGDfri04gxtAqAvkHMw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/87tmTU1NSR5EUGTKsF5rhLwZtZc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After graduating from Emory University in 1992, top student and athlete Christopher McCandless abandons his possessions, gives his entire $24,000 savings account to charity, and hitchhikes to Alaska to live in the wilderness.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645576,\"title\":\"A Heist with Markiplier\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/QwfGRbVFDXpMSAUU4whDHUvEQR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Fp07TNoYXBYly13LMCDv2P46xK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"You join Markiplier on the heist of a lifetime, but in this original comedic interactive story you decide how the heist turns out in the end. Choose wisely.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"UkMuGKqAux4\",\"name\":\"New International Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"bfCgu83suHs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer 2\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"JFQcDFhNh4o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}